Package: fessel-monitor
Version: @VERSION@
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-pydantic, python3-paho-mqtt, python3-yaml, python3-fastapi, python3-uvicorn, python3-uvloop, python3-httptools, python3-websockets, python3-watchfiles, python3-gi, gir1.2-gst-plugins-bad-1.0, gstreamer1.0-plugins-base, gstreamer1.0-plugins-good, gstreamer1.0-plugins-bad, gstreamer1.0-tools, mosquitto, v4l-utils
Maintainer: Fessel <noreply@example.com>
Description: Fessel robot-arm monitoring (Pi side)
 supervisor (safety/control plane + MQTT relay) and video (GStreamer
 pipeline + live state machine), shipped as system-integrated Python modules
 under /opt/fessel/lib relying on Debian python3-* packages (no venv), with
 launcher wrappers in /usr/bin and their systemd units. Configuration lives
 in /etc/fessel and is preserved across upgrades.
